# A126723

Irregular triangle read by rows: row n (>= 1) gives coefficients c(0), c(1), c(2),... arising from the greedy-algorithm representation of n as n = c(0)/x + c(1)/x^2 + c(2)/x^3 + ..., where x = (1+sqrt(5))/2.

The 100 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

